    </section>


    <!-- INTRODUCTION -->
    <section class="section intro-section">

        <div class="section-heading">

            <span class="eyebrow">About This Service</span>

            <h2>Make Your Book Listing More Informative and Engaging</h2>

            <div class="gold-line"></div>

        </div>

        <p>
            A book listing should clearly communicate what a book
            offers and help the intended audience understand its
            subject, genre and value.
        </p>

        <p>
            WMF's Amazon Optimization & A+ Content service supports
            authors with listing metadata guidance, keyword research
            and enhanced A+ Content design where the book and account
            are eligible.
        </p>

        <p>
            The service focuses on improving presentation and
            discoverability support. It does not guarantee sales,
            rankings, reviews or advertising results.
        </p>

    </section>


    <!-- SERVICE FEATURES -->
    <section class="section">

        <div class="section-heading">

            <span class="eyebrow">What We Do</span>

            <h2>Optimization Support for Your Book</h2>

            <div class="gold-line"></div>

            <p>
                The specific deliverables depend on the scope
                approved for your project.
            </p>

        </div>

        <div class="service-grid">

            <div class="service-card">

                <h3>Metadata Support</h3>

                <p>
                    Review and guidance for relevant book listing
                    information so your book is presented clearly.
                </p>

            </div>

            <div class="service-card">

                <h3>Keyword Research</h3>

                <p>
                    Research relevant search terms that may help
                    inform your book's listing and audience positioning.
                </p>

            </div>

            <div class="service-card">

                <h3>A+ Content Design</h3>

                <p>
                    Design support for enhanced book listing content
                    where the relevant Amazon programme and account
                    are eligible.
                </p>

            </div>

        </div>

    </section>


    <!-- SCOPE -->
    <section class="section scope-section">

        <div class="section-heading">

            <span class="eyebrow">Project Scope</span>

            <h2>What's Included and What's Not</h2>

            <div class="gold-line"></div>

        </div>

        <div class="scope-grid">

            <div class="scope-box">

                <h3>Potential Deliverables</h3>

                <ul>
                    <li>Book listing information review.</li>
                    <li>Metadata support and recommendations.</li>
                    <li>Relevant keyword research.</li>
                    <li>Keyword recommendations for agreed listing fields.</li>
                    <li>A+ Content design assets where eligible and selected.</li>
                    <li>Final deliverables in agreed formats.</li>
                </ul>

            </div>

            <div class="scope-box">

                <h3>Not Automatically Included</h3>

                <ul>
                    <li>Guaranteed Amazon rankings or sales.</li>
                    <li>Guaranteed reviews or customer engagement.</li>
                    <li>Amazon advertising campaign management.</li>
                    <li>Amazon account ownership or access.</li>
                    <li>Third-party subscriptions or platform fees.</li>
                    <li>Publishing or distribution services outside the agreed scope.</li>
                </ul>

            </div>

        </div>

        <div class="notice">
            A+ Content availability depends on Amazon's eligibility
            rules and the author's account or publishing arrangement.
            WMF cannot guarantee approval or publication of submitted
            content by Amazon.
        </div>

    </section>


    <!-- PACKAGES -->
    <section class="section package-section">

        <div class="section-heading">

            <span class="eyebrow">Service Packages</span>

            <h2>Choose Your Optimization Package</h2>

            <div class="gold-line"></div>

            <p>
                Select the level of support you want to discuss
                with WMF. Final deliverables will be confirmed
                before payment.
            </p>

        </div>

